<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury raises 939.5 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury raises 939.5 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 939.5 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    13 weeks	 304	   304		  7.5 pct</p>
<p>    52 weeks	 500	   500		  8.5</p>
<p>    Two years     83.5	  83.5		  8.8</p>
<p>    Five years	37	    37		  9.5</p>
<p>    10 years	 170	   nil		 10.20</p>
<p>    15 years	 483	    15		 10.25</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	 1,577.5	 939.5</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for April 7, 1997.</p>
<p>($1= 9.2 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 72 65 18</p>
